        "id": 40758,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-24T11:48:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Bleh,I move my played cards around so as to keep track of them - usually I may have Ongoings, then Equipment cards. Or maybe ones that do similar things, such as buff damage, which I do in the case of Ra - I have the Staff and erm, that Ongoing that givse him +1 damage together at the \"start\" (ie left-hand side) of the line, then other stuff afterwards. I do similar with my hand, grouping card types together (Equipment, Ongoing, Limited, One-Shot, etc). Also, does anyone playing ever actually have their hand <span class=\"bbcode-i\">in their hand</span>? We've never bothered - there's no reason to hide your cards from other players and there's no way I'd be able to read most of them in the case of those heroes who tend to end up with a very large hand to choose from, eg Tachyon and Nightmist.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
