      {
        "id": 40762,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-24T13:17:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry for not chiming in on this sooner! Being in Germany and all.&nbsp;</p><p>Avalon has it 100% correct. Cards act in order of play. Effects on a card happen in printed order. Simultaneous actions within those distinctions are decided by players.</p><p>Hope this helps. Let me know if this is additionally unclear.</p>",
