      {
        "id": 40763,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-24T13:23:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess the only thing missing now is something to aid in keeping track the order of cards played.</p><p>Well.. one thing I can think of is to have pen + paper or marker + marker board or something, and (as organized by event type) write down the&nbsp;cards that respond to each event.&nbsp; Since cards would have to be written in order anyway, and by grouping by event type, it would probably make the game flow easier.</p><p>I may try something like this the next game I get to play.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:14:26.564Z",
