        "created_at": "2012-10-24T14:52:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That also requires me to have tokens of various colors which are numbered.&nbsp; I think in my case, something to write with and something to write on would be more readily available.&nbsp; Not that the token colors would be bad.</p>",
