        "created_at": "2012-10-24T20:07:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lol...well, in the first two-player game we played, I did try playing as two of the heroes - Tachyon (my first time playing her) and Wraith (whom I'd played numerous times before). So yeah...not the best combo in terms of using a small amount of table space ;). The tables at both of our houses are fairly large, actually, but about three quarters of mine and about two thirds of his (slightly smaller table) is covered in other people's crap so we have to make do with basically one end/corner :P.</p>",
