        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-02T15:38:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wait. I'm a little confused.&nbsp;Let me know if I udnerstand this correctly.</p><p>Tempest's pwoer that deals 1 damage to all non-hero targets.&nbsp;</p><p>It does NOT affect everything at once, but card by card, based on the order they were placed?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
