      {
        "id": 40777,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-02T15:44:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is half correct.&nbsp; It does not effect everthing at once, that is true.&nbsp;&nbsp;However, this is an action specified on a single card which affects multiple cards, and thus you choose the order of the cards that are effected.&nbsp; The only time card order matters is when multiple cards react to a single event.</p>",
