        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-02T15:45:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No, not in the order it was placed. &nbsp;There's another thread on this somewhere, but the basics are:</p><p>1) When multiple different cards or effects try to occur \"at the same time\", they are resolved in card order.</p><p>2) When a single effect tries to do multiple things at once (i.e. damage all targets, destroy all ongoings, etc) they occur in an order determined by the players.</p><p>(Edit: ninja-ed!)</p>",
